<section id="about" class="studio-about studio-wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="about-copy" data-reveal><p class="studio-eyebrow">05 / OUR BEGINNING</p><h2 id="about-title">从一个想法，<br>到一起进场。</h2><p><%= studio.name %>的构想，始于 2025 年 5 月。<br>由椰伦苏创立，如今与 sendu、尘埃组成三人小队，围绕《<%= studio.game %>》提供护航、娱乐和陪玩服务。</p><p>“森口”，取“牲口”的谐音，代表我们认定的凶猛、可靠与一往无前。敢迎着挑战向前，也做队友可以信赖的后盾。</p><div class="studio-values"><img src="<%= url_for('/assets/welkin/studio-logo.svg') %>" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy"><span><strong>凶猛 / 可靠 / 一往无前</strong><small>FORWARD. TOGETHER.</small></span></div></div><ol class="studio-timeline"><li data-reveal><span class="timeline-date"><%= studio.idea_date %></span><div><h3>一个想法，开始萌芽。</h3><p>最初提出森口电竞工作室的构想。</p></div></li><li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="80"><span class="timeline-date">OUR SQUAD</span><div><h3>三个人，凑成一队。</h3><p>椰伦苏创立工作室，与 sendu、尘埃并肩。</p></div></li><li data-reveal data-reveal-delay="160"<% if (studio.launch_planned) { %> class="timeline-future"<% } %>><span class="timeline-date"><%= studio.launch_date %></span><div><h3><%= studio.launch_planned ? '计划正式成立。' : '工作室正式成立。' %><% if (studio.launch_planned) { %><small>未来计划</small><% } %></h3><p>把森口电竞的故事，继续写下去。</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section id="contact" class="studio-contact studio-wrap" data-reveal aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="contact-kicker"><span class="studio-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>NEXT GAME / 下一场见</div><div class="contact-main"><h2 id="contact-title">下次开局，<br>算上我们。</h2><div class="contact-details"><p>想打护航，轻松娱乐，还是找人陪玩？<br>先聊聊你的想法，再约一场合拍的局。</p><% if (studio.contact && studio.contact.url) { %><a class="studio-button" href="<%= studio.contact.url %>"><%= studio.contact.label || '联系森口电竞' %> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } else { %><span class="contact-pending">预约联系方式待公布</span><a class="studio-text-link" href="<%= url_for('/contact/') %>">预约前先了解 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %></div></div><div class="contact-bottom"><span>护航 / 娱乐 / 陪玩</span><span><span>GOOD COMPANY, GOOD GAME.</span></span></div></section>